Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:05:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第8集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.59,0:00:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:05.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能就这么看着我  对我说你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just look me in the face and tell me you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你失眠  还大量饮酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sleeping, you drink for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.65,0:00:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这副样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are those the actions of someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能分清是非\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows they did the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我撒谎  杀了我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me, and you killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:13.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死艾米可没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Amy was not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你下不了手  所以我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't do it, so I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在甚至不能跟你呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can't even be around you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不如忍耐一下跟我一起搞定这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might as well bite the bullet and work with me on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我能不能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  咱们一起阻止杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, let's try and stop the killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我想我们还是坐一辆车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. I figured we'd take one car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you know what? You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米的事  我理解你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}About amy. I get why you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是为了保证没有别人会再受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just trying to make sure no one else got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说有这么一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying this is a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.15,0:00:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是一本  是一系列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books. It was a series.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过卖得不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't sell a lot of copies, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克  我是你的头号粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck, I am your number-one fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道《凶鬼恶灵》只是一本书而已  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know that "Supernatural" Is just a book, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-贝基  那些都是真的  -我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Becky, it's all real. - I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-女士  你没事吧  -真的是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, lady? Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-能否请你不要再摸我了  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you... Quit touching me? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(内华达州  拉斯维加斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  说出来你肯定不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you won't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人都以为我这么说  是为了多拿小费\N{\fnArial\fs30}People think I just say it to get a bigger tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我在读研究生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I'm in grad school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  就是这种眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Okay? There's a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  这么看你  是因为我喜欢聪明的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is my "I dig smart chicks" Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果学校里的女生都穿成你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if they, uh, if they wore that, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时就不会辍学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have dropped out of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你有什么心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.39,0:01:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进来时的表情  就好像谁把你家狗杀了似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came in here looking like somebody shot your puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你下班了  情况也有所好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, things are looking up now that your shift's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的一个朋友  他有个弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this friend. He's got this younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脑子有点不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? Cannon's a little loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久之前  他犯病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, his reactor blew a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我朋友他...他一直在等\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend -- he's, uh... He's kind of been sitting,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他弟弟再发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting to see if he goes guano again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜他弟弟惹麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assume it just hit the fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但事实上没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the thing. It didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:02:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一个疯子来说  那孩子现在算是正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid's all reasonable now, considering he's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  他...他不是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's -- I mean, he's not crazy. He --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看上去似乎又好转的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's starting to seem like things might be getting a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那算是件好事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a good thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就是个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a freakin' miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在他们哥俩...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it happens during their, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踏上一年一度的维加斯朝圣之旅时\N{\fnArial\fs30}their sacred annual pilgrimage to Vegas...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他却自己一个人去沙漠里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he goes off on some Granola-munching hike
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.11,0:02:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潇洒地远足去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the desert by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能只是想一个人静静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe he just needs some time alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都有需要面对自我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all need to face ourselves sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能确实需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.66,0:02:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't talking about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说曹操  曹操到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他离这儿只有四个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's four blocks away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  弟弟还是需要你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Baby bro needs you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.78,0:03:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  不需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. You won't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快来  -我还以为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - I thought you were out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与大自然天人合一神马的\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, becoming one with the land or some crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得...过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to -- come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然  粉色代表着忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, apparently, uh, pink is for loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, what's the pretext?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们...是婚礼傲客(美国喜剧)吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we -- uh, wedding crashers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找海妖什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lookin' for some kind of siren or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那么回事  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Nothing like that. All right, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事有点突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a little sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过人生苦短  我就长话短说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But life is short, so I'll keep this shorter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.89,0:04:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恋爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:06.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说点什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something, like, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是"恭喜你"之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, "Congratulations," for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.33,0:04:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.42,0:05:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道她不应该征得我的同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't she ask for my permission or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.99,0:05:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让她向你提亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you want her to ask for my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in the --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么走到一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长话短说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short version?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们...  我们相遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we -- we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们吃饭  聊天  然后相爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ate and -- and talked and fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.83,0:05:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就走到这一步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我基本上了解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I-I guess I'm all caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你猜怎么着  先不管别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Ignoring everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘了  你钓的马子都活不长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you forgotten the average life-span of your hookups?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得  但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但最了解情况的人  莫过于我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if anyone knows that, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每本书都读过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I read every book.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我完全理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, open eyes, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理解万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我快要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  事情很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, it's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸福来了  我得抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-if something good's happening, I-I got to jump on it --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.27,0:05:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住今时今日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, today, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我玩《死亡诗社》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, "Dead poets society." fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯  不过你确定她不是什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense -- did you make sure she's even really --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盐  圣水  什么都用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt, holy water, everything.
