Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  既然说到了书的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, speaking of the whole, uh, book thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基只是碰巧在维加斯出现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky randomly shows up during Vegas week?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你究竟想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, what are you trying to say?
