Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但请你相信  我一定能查出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, believe me, I will find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.21,0:13:56.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  不要这样跟我老婆说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, that's...my wife you're talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:13:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的表现太异常了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even acting like yourself, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.89,0:13:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你娶了贝基·罗森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You married Becky Rosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是女巫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:06.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是海妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I'm a siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就没想过  我们只是很幸福吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever occur to you we're just -- I don't know -- happy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是中乐透  又是功成名就的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy wins the lotto, guy hits the bigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再明显不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这镇上  人人都梦想成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, people's dreams are coming true in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不觉得这未免太巧合了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think this is a little bit of a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基和我绝对是真情所致\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Becky and I have is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你接受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you can't accept that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的问题  绝非我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your problem, not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许她也有份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe she's part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:35.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种种迹象都表明  你正是她的梦中情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because for whatever reason, you're her dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.55,0:14:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真心在意她  就该担心她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really do care about her, I'd be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那些美梦成真  得偿所愿的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because people who do get their little fantasies or whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎都立刻死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}seem to end up dead pretty quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  也许你之所以无法接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I went after her, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.11,0:14:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我与贝基结了婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's what's bugging you --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始了自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'm moving on with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你一直照顾我  那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you took care of me, and that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我已不再需要你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要别的搭档  鲍比  你干嘛不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want another hunter, Bobby. Why can't you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙叫啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你准备了一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小两口的假身份证\N{\fnArial\fs30}His and hers fake I.D.?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿  瞧瞧这篇报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.55,0:15:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联合自由保险公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Junior salesman leapfrogs to C.E.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:02.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一名初级销售员跃升为执行总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Mutual Freedom Insurance."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这个执行总裁是源头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the C.E.O. is a lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:07.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Becky?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.31,0:16:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看这个执行总裁的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think about the C.E.O.?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩去试探他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go pretext him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你会高点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I thought you'd be taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想鲍比已经将把情况都跟告诉你了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume Bobby filled you in on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就告诉了我两件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.98,0:17:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一  他现在正忙着在俄勒冈州大地上建立大本营\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, he's tangling with a major-league nest up in Oregon territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numero dos,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:15.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提到了你  \N{\fnArial\fs30}he said you'd be all, uh, 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.41,0:17:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对跟我公事的事有点经前狂躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}surly and premenstrual working with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  伙计  说说而已  别受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, man, sticks and stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I found a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧标题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the headline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要的先做\N{\fnArial\fs30}First thing's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:44.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马默杜克  真够疯狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Marmaduke, you're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在侮辱我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to humiliate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是草字头的莎  玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Marsha with an "S-H-A,"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是只有三点水的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a "C-I-A."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再次谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那是你的...  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, is that your -- - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:13.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要进去了  毫无异样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, no point in going in. Guy's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  绝对的  贝基拷问起来完全专业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Positive. Becky grilled him like a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:22.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她简直就是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a real natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个瘦皮猴是干嘛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what's with the scrawny guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,临时搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在真是扔一块石头也能砸着个记者啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw a rock, hit a reporter these days, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很重视你的故事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your story's a big deal over at the, uh, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们《真实内幕》很看重\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Actuarial Insider.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  问吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么得到机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh... How'd you get the gig?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,董事会找到我  问我是否愿意  我当然说愿意啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Board came to me, asked. Said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just out of the blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.85,0:18:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想过董事会为什么会找上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. And, uh, any idea how the board landed on you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至跳过了你的上级\N{\fnArial\fs30}over your supervisors?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.57,0:19:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们没提过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, they didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你能说说你自身有什么实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you tell us what specifically excited the board
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让董事会这么钟情于你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your actual qualifications?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  两位  你们这么刨根问底是要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, fellas, what's with the third degree?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  请别见怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, no offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想知道你究竟用了什么歪门邪道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just wondering if you got here by nefarious means.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然不是那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I-I didn't mean, of course, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是指暗箭伤人之类的  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}corporate backstabbing -- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant more like,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑魔法啊或是巫毒术之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know, black magic or hoodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑的  他就是  就是喜欢开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He jokes. He's a -- he's a jokester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们  还是回到正题上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's, uh, rewind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如  不如你说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't, uh, why don't you tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.87,0:19:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己梦想成真的感觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}what it felt like when your big dream came true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,官方说法的话  感觉棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, on the record, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,私下来说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the record?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不算是我梦寐以求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my big dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  你不想要这份工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You didn't want this job?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  不想  我就是个售货员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no. I'm a sales guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我擅长卖东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was good in sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的秘书真是个二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your secretary's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下午我去印刷商那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be at the printers this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  亲爱的  一起吃晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Dear. See you at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:01.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就叫那个二货预定好餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just have the idiot make a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如这样  提醒她  她可是执行总裁秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a tip -- remind her she works for the C.E.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再搞砸了  就让她卷铺盖走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more screw-up, she's fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太太对你的晋升似乎很激动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your, uh, wife seems pretty stoked on the promotion, don't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  我从没见她这么开心过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I've never seen her happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么告诉她我不得不辞职的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea how I'm gonna tell her I have to resign.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.01,0:20:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这个消息一定会  -打击死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The news is just gonna -- - Kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴罗斯太太  你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Burrows? Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.22,0:20:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要作一篇你丈夫晋升的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we're, uh, we're doing a story on your husband's promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也想采访一下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  今天不行  先跟他秘书预约吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I can't today. If you schedule it with his girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.72,0:20:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想帮你免遭可怕意外的厄运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to save you from a really bad accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在威胁我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you threatening me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.79,0:20:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我只是指出一个规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I'm pointing out a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么总是有人觉得我是在威胁他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do people keep thinking I'm threatening them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.98,0:20:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那听起来确实就像威胁  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it sounded exactly like a threat, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.55,0:20:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  这是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, for your own good, 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你动了什么手脚让他升职\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did you do to get him promoted?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全不懂你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在别再来烦我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.93,0:20:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我就打电话叫保安了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do I have to call security?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不 不  有什么被遗漏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, something's not adding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我敢肯定我们会时来运转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we'll get a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦结束了手上的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"As soon as we're done working,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浪漫的蜜月就将展开\N{\fnArial\fs30}romantic honeymoon getaway."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把车开过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the damn car around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想踩着高跟鞋走五个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not walking five blocks in my heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:50.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你并不是第一个  来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're not the first. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想告诉我们这是怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell us what's up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在跟朋友吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was having lunch with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人听到我抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy heard me bitching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.07,0:22:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来他就向我提出了一个提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing I know, he's making me an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}An offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用我的灵魂换克雷格的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Craig's job for my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道很滑稽  我有什么可以失去的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Hilarious. I mean, what have I got to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.71,0:22:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的灵魂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.39,0:22:17.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么恶魔交易  期限很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of demon deal is this? Timeline's wack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在说什么  恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? "Demon"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.25,0:22:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来说下背景资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me back up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.55,0:22:24.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟恶魔做交易  以不灭的灵魂换取愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a deal with a demon in exchange for your everlasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过那些都是十年期的合同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except those are 10-year contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么快就来收账了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's the bill coming due so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.17,0:22:30.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  但我对下一个是谁有不祥预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but I got a bad feeling about who's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找到萨姆  要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find Sam, pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧  好吧  计划是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, all right. Uh, here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.65,0:22:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这位女士送到我表兄家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drop this lady at my cousin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会阻止任何想要接近她的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll stop anything trying to get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:40.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找萨姆  希望能收拾好这烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh, find Sam, hopefully fix this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:42.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家就都能及时赶回家看《美国达人》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody's home in time for "America's got talent".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你要跟一个  截瘫的狙击手一起住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you -- you'll be living with a triracial paraplegic sniper
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到这事结束  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}until this all blows over, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖  你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.53,0:22:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要马上见个面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to meet up, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.90,0:22:53.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在失去萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.09,0:22:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎  怎么  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what's -- what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得了吗  我们结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember? We're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, g--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要打电话给迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.25,0:23:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你有没有觉得有点脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, do you feel concussion-y?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我举了几根手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many fingers am I holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在哪里  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I? What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.90,0:23:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam... Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.23,0:23:37.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静  你把我绑在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down?! You hogtied me t--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  我  我为什么没穿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, why -- why am I not wearing any pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.45,0:23:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裤子太勒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're very constricting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.45,0:23:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  我没做什么奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I didn't do anything weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.38,0:23:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上放了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你渴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是你需要一个瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you need a bottle...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.96,0:23:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  撒尿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to, you know, tinkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要的话也没关系  我可以帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay if you do. I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.26,0:23:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:00.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  什么情况  贝基  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What? Wait. Becky? Becky. Hey, hey, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.40,0:24:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.31,0:24:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.85,0:24:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收到你的信息了  有麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your messages. Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.25,0:24:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.92,0:24:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在我父母的小屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at my parents' cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.76,0:24:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把萨姆绑在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got Sam tied to a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.66,0:24:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有魔法药水了  再给我一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of elixir. I need a refill, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.67,0:24:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是我想要的蜜月\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the honeymoon I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一部分是  但不是这个样子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, some of it is, but not in this context.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.50,0:24:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道只有我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is it just me, or is
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.73,0:24:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西真的消耗得越来越快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this stuff wearing off faster and faster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.13,0:24:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky...breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.77,0:24:35.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知不知道我们还没有圆房呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know we haven't even consummated our marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.10,0:24:38.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们慢慢来是因为真爱是永恒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were taking it slow 'cause true love is forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在一切都感觉好奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everything just feels weird now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们一个小时后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Meet me in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.00,0:24:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我吃了爱情魔药\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you dosed me with a love potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.03,0:24:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么  -隔墙有耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How -- - Thin walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.90,0:24:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我是用了社交润滑剂来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I used a social lubricant to --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.59,0:24:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我下药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You roofied me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.89,0:24:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下药  我绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A roofie? I'd never.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.43,0:25:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在一起很快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a great time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.08,0:25:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.39,0:25:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我很激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. I'm thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.14,0:25:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.18,0:25:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道是盖杀了那些人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your pal Guy is the one icing all those people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.55,0:25:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.87,0:25:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道他不是巫师吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so he's not a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.73,0:25:15.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.33,0:25:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是个巫士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a wiccan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.27,0:25:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫士都是好人  就像《奥兹国的格琳达》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiccans are good, like Glinda of Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.45,0:25:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.44,0:25:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  你不是这么傻吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not this stupid, Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.06,0:25:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是什么在杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever is killing people...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.55,0:25:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来都没有别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.23,0:25:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候有过一个镇上发生两件怪事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are there ever two crazy things in town at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.98,0:25:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖不是好东西  而你也要被他宰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy's the creep, and you're on his list.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.68,0:25:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.27,0:25:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他是你的交易人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's your dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.04,0:25:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.81,0:25:42.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以什么为回报卖你欧芫菁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much he's charging you for that spanish fly --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.59,0:25:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有  他送给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing! He gives it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.99,0:25:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且他说如果不是你内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he said it wouldn't even work
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.07,0:25:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早已爱上我的话  这东西是不会管用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you already loved me, deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.28,0:25:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西不过是把你的爱激发出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just activates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.97,0:25:52.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think I love you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.45,0:25:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许在内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep, deep down?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.40,0:25:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就给我松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then untie me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.19,0:26:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.41,0:26:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在整理你的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still working through your emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.96,0:26:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.86,0:26:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎来到2001届毕业生十年聚会)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.92,0:26:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放在桌上  就在名牌边上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the table, next to the nametags.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.12,0:26:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.15,0:26:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如坐下再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take a seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天不顺吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough day?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.28,0:26:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.39,0:26:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想  我们就直奔主题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can cut right to it if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:42.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来谈谈价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk price.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.44,0:26:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.78,0:26:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得我们已经有点过了免费赠品的阶段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're a little past the freebie stage, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.52,0:26:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我以为我们是闺蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought we were besties.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.47,0:26:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.49,0:26:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真是"贝基"的让人郁闷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so depressingly "Becky."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.77,0:26:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's -- you're so pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.94,0:27:02.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可悲到可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it actually loops back around again to cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.80,0:27:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你要我付钱  可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You want me to pay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.07,0:27:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你接受个人支票吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you accept personal checks?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.00,0:27:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.41,0:27:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我接受你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will take your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.62,0:27:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.37,0:27:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo, bango!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.25,0:27:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢同学聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love reunions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.15,0:27:25.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The desperation!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.93,0:27:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那帮蠢货会为了金钱  权利  头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}These schlubs will sign on the dotted line
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.86,0:27:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而跟我交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}for money, power, hair --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:32.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜一切代价给当年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes to impress
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.08,0:27:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光鲜夺目的啦啦队长留下好印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}the nostalgically bangable head cheerleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.48,0:27:38.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.36,0:27:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你杀了那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.27,0:27:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是从法律上看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for legal reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.46,0:27:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只说他们遭遇了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just say they had...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.03,0:27:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的意外事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}unfortunate accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.11,0:27:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎样  我交出自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, I hand over my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.58,0:27:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就会有一台钢琴砸我头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next day a piano falls on my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.57,0:27:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我才不会那样对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'd never do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.83,0:27:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.92,0:27:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.22,0:27:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are special.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.40,0:28:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.30,0:28:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的新丈夫是怪人萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't thrilled to see your new hubby
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.24,0:28:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对我不是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}was Sam freakin' Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.60,0:28:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if he knew
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.82,0:28:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在和你说这些  他很可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was here talking to you, I mean, he'd probably --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爆你的菊  -就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gank your ass. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.71,0:28:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是对我的小菊花保护有加的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm very protective of my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.91,0:28:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我最漂亮的地方之一了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of my best features.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.69,0:28:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  我准备给你提供一份一次性交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, I'm prepared to offer you a one-time-only deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.93,0:28:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是二十五\N{\fnArial\fs30}25.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.05,0:28:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会用钢琴砸你  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pianos, guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.14,0:28:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿走我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.16,0:28:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还需要保证不会向温彻斯特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your promise to not breathe a word about this
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.43,0:28:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,透露只字片语\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the winchesters,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.90,0:28:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就屁颠屁颠地走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll be on my merry way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.97,0:28:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人得到过这么好的交易  贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one gets a deal like this, Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.51,0:28:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王  教皇都没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not kings, not popes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.35,0:28:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只需一弹指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snap my fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.30,0:28:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆在你的余生都会爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sam will love you for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在想喝一杯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll have that drink now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.09,0:29:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.05,0:29:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她发了十一条微博\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, she's got 11 twitter...ers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.21,0:29:39.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last post --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.60,0:29:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"踏上与老公的浪漫之旅"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Going on romantic trip with Hubster!!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.54,0:29:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打了三个感叹号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three exclamation points.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.30,0:29:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜她应该很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess she got excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.93,0:29:49.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这看起来浪漫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That look romantic to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.80,0:29:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.30,0:29:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我个人而言不喜欢鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got this thing about fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.24,0:29:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死鱼眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead eyes, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.13,0:30:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我心中的同学聚会可不是这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not how I imagined spending my reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.65,0:30:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本想带着你四处炫耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna show you off --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.83,0:30:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不能让别人知道你的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that anyone actually knows who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.61,0:30:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》现在已经不火了  可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" is not exactly popular, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.12,0:30:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你如此的高大...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tall...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.29,0:30:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和气...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nice and...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.37,0:30:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都会认为我过得很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}...they'd all think I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.53,0:30:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你生我气  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mad. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.08,0:30:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.17,0:30:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能谈谈么\N{\fnArial\fs30}can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.30,0:31:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.70,0:31:02.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有自知之明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I am, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.30,0:31:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.13,0:31:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是在学校还是在生活中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In school, in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.60,0:31:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这也是为什么我会这么喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess that's why I like you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.74,0:31:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.73,0:31:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说你是个失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not that you're a loser,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.87,0:31:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你具备成为一个怪胎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you had that whole character arc
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.80,0:31:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的品质特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}about being a freak, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.07,0:31:21.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我都能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.18,0:31:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.27,0:31:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯一能让人们理解我的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only place people understood me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.39,0:31:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是留言板了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the message boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.66,0:31:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然都是些暴躁且偏激的文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were grumpy and overly literal,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.88,0:31:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但至少我们有共同的喜好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least we shared a common passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.99,0:31:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我乐在其中  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll take it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.26,0:31:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我遇到了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I met you guys --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.78,0:31:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如假包换的萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.64,0:31:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始和恰克约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I started dating Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.54,0:31:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything was...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.20,0:31:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太美妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.18,0:31:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你们离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you left,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.47,0:31:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克也把我甩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Chuck dumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.79,0:32:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是我旺盛的性欲把他吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I intimidated him with my vibrant sexuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.86,0:32:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是希望有人能爱真正的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want someone who loves me for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.00,0:32:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这要求很过分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.03,0:32:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.63,0:32:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你希望有人爱真正的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want somebody to love you for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.95,0:32:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就别给他们下药\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe don't drug them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.80,0:32:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.10,0:32:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.44,0:32:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  你不是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, you're better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.40,0:32:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴真甜  可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's sweet, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.80,0:32:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.38,0:32:45.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becks!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.74,0:32:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错过派对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.32,0:32:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.27,0:32:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.37,0:32:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.33,0:32:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.15,0:33:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.63,0:33:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的决定是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.64,0:33:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.23,0:33:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.89,0:33:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们接个吻就搞定了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seal the deal with a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.78,0:33:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.19,0:33:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴撅起来  甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pucker up, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.19,0:33:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是你的甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.35,0:33:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蓝莓味的伏特加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blueberry vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.58,0:33:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为您解决一切生活烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer to all of life's problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.66,0:33:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that, Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.11,0:33:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我按我们说的做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it just like we said!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.86,0:33:40.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是太牛叉了  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am awesome! I --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.30,0:33:42.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.92,0:33:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.38,0:33:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是让人太兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really thrilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.81,0:33:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给我签个名吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I have your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.34,0:33:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.90,0:33:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会  把它刻在你的脾脏上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll, uh, carve it into your spleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.89,0:33:57.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么操作你那套小把戏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how you running your little scam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.86,0:34:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么呢  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how do you mean, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.80,0:34:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,签署十年条约  把他们的灵魂吸走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signing 10-year deals, snuffing 'em that week.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.63,0:34:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没做过  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I would never. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.82,0:34:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道上的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rules of the road --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.05,0:34:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能伤害我的客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't lay a hair on any of my clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.83,0:34:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你怎么作弊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So how you cheating it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.54,0:34:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是骗子  我是革新者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a cheater. I'm an innovator.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.62,0:34:17.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫钻空子  你个傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a loophole, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.98,0:34:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  当一个人出售自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, when a person bargains away his soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.44,0:34:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按理说  他有十年时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}he gets a decade, technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.33,0:34:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意外时有发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But accidents happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.78,0:34:29.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你安排这些"意外"然后再提前收集灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're arranging "accidents" and collecting early?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.18,0:34:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  我的手很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. White gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.56,0:34:33.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事不用脏了我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get my hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.38,0:34:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此有一个能干的实习生是很重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it's important to have a capable intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.66,0:34:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你什么时候来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time did I ask you to be here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.36,0:34:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你什么时候来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time did I ask you to be here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.13,0:35:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.15,0:35:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky...run!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.14,0:35:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦道夫(庞氏骗局策划者)  你在这镇上做了多少交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many deals you got cooking in this town, Madoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.42,0:35:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.73,0:35:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十五笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}15.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.08,0:35:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, call them off,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.65,0:35:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就在你喉咙上钻个空子\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll cut my own loophole in your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.73,0:35:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.93,0:35:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你说的对  你现在就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you said it. You're in a world --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.07,0:35:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩儿们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.40,0:35:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.10,0:36:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  恭喜  那位幸运的女士是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, mazel tov. Who's the lucky lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.45,0:36:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.97,0:36:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.46,0:36:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我相信你一定很有人格魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure you have a wonderful personality, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.92,0:36:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再上前一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, another step,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.64,0:36:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在你这位朋友喉咙上划一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll colombian necktie your little friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.05,0:36:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  别让他死得这么容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't let him get off that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.91,0:36:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  我觉得你不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I don't think that you --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.49,0:36:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我清楚知道你都干了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly what you've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.30,0:36:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个叫杰克逊的小鸟已经把你给卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little birdie named Jackson sold you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.90,0:36:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你那些丑事都发电邮到我的意见箱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}e-mailed all the juicy deets to my suggestion box.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.68,0:36:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.10,0:36:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我的告密人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's my whistle-blower?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.01,0:36:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜  还有大好前途呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame. Had a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.06,0:36:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是  你就没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.31,0:36:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我只是  -只有一个规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just -- - There's only one rule --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.03,0:36:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做了交易  就要遵守\N{\fnArial\fs30}make a deal, keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.37,0:36:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,严格说来  我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, technically, I didn't --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.88,0:36:56.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不提前收账是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason we don't call our chits in early --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.81,0:36:58.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消费者信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}consumer confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.38,0:37:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是华尔街  而是地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't Wall Street! This is hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.61,0:37:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是要讲诚信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a little something called integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.95,0:37:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有诚信  谁来跟我们交易  没人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gets out, who'll deal with us? Nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.76,0:37:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where are we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.85,0:37:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.87,0:37:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你是不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.41,0:37:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是个愚蠢而又鄙陋的傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're a stupid, shortsighted little prat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.56,0:37:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  把这蠢货交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, hand the jackass over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.72,0:37:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会取消他每一笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cancel every deal he's made.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.28,0:37:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要拿他怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.36,0:37:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀鸡儆猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make an example of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.56,0:37:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公平交易  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair trade, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.31,0:37:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就各行其路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.07,0:37:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用造成伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.25,0:37:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  突然大发善心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, out of the goodness of your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.66,0:37:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多年追杀你的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years of demons nipping at your heels,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却已经几个月没见到了  想知道原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}haven't seen one for months. Wonder why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.50,0:37:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.90,0:37:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎杀利维坦  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting Leviathan -- yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.79,0:37:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此我叫小的们别去碍你们两个笨蛋的眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I told my lads to stay clear of you meatheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.97,0:37:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you know about --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.10,0:37:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太多了  你们见过那家伙了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much. You met that dick yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.98,0:37:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自墨索里尼(意大利法西斯党首领)以来最自命不凡的一桶粘液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smuggest tub of goo since Mussolini.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.24,0:37:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.88,0:37:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌那帮王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.25,0:37:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托把他们都灭了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squash 'em all, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.44,0:37:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不来碍事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.84,0:38:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先撕毁合同再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip up the contracts first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.65,0:38:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞定  统统搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done...and done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.44,0:38:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.30,0:38:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不要  让\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. Let --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.86,0:38:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很乐意  绅士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.84,0:38:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都错过什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.42,0:38:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也\N{\fnArial\fs30}It...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.52,0:38:39.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有很糟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't all bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.53,0:38:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  你确实救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, y-you did save my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.42,0:38:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了那个  谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for that, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.25,0:38:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们还会见面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'll see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.27,0:38:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.75,0:39:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.63,0:39:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是个失败者  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a loser, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.89,0:39:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好人  你还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good person, a-and you've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.42,0:39:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.27,0:39:22.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}e-energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.40,0:39:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好自己的事  无论是什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know, just do your thing, whatever that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.25,0:39:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你命中注定的那个人一定会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the right guy will find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.09,0:39:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.96,0:39:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.46,0:39:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, buddy, I got to say, man --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.83,0:39:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  你还挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you, uh... you don't suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:39:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.84,0:39:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是人家跟我说的最中听的一句话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the nicest thing anyone's ever said to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.60,0:40:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. All right, that's --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.49,0:40:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.22,0:40:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.35,0:40:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你交了个朋友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, you made a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.82,0:40:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.13,0:40:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被下药的时候  说了些乱七八糟的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}...when I was all dosed up, I-I said some crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.75,0:40:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  她  她不是你的灵魂伴侣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean, she -- she wasn't your soul mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.27,0:40:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.19,0:40:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我确实需要你照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I do need you watching my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.38,0:40:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  当疯狂的粉丝来袭之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when, uh, crazy groupies attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.28,0:40:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂我的意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.50,0:40:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got to say, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.51,0:40:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个疯子  你真的很振作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a wackjob, you really pulled it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.24,0:40:54.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是人家跟我说的最中听的一句话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the nicest thing anyone's said to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.21,0:40:57.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别太感动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, don't be too impressed, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.95,0:40:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我脑子里还是挺乱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still a Denver scramble up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.91,0:41:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才刚有点清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know my way around the plate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.23,0:41:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.17,0:41:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你一直需要我在身边是很蠢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stupid to think that you need me around all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.75,0:41:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个大人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.84,0:41:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.73,0:41:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个沙漠独行  嬉皮二货型的大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hike-in-the-desert, hippie-douche grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.31,0:41:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  我在露营  你也露营的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I was camping. You camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.02,0:41:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便了  嬉皮士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever. Hippie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.36,0:41:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  一本正经说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, though? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.95,0:41:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可能挺不错的  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It might be nice. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.49,0:41:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你基本上整个人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you basically have been looking out for me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.98,0:41:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是在照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your whole life.
